WEBVTT

1
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:13,390
Where to put these dishes?

2
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:17,860
I'll put the dishes away and put them by the door later. I'll move them myself.

3
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:19,950
Warehouse rights are withheld first.

4
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,680
Gotta let it steam on its own

5
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:23,080
Lord Ling

6
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:25,620
I'm here to deliver vegetables. How are the seeds?

7
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,740
My dad said it can be ready in a week

8
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,140
There is no room for them at home

9
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,300
Don’t give me supplies yet

10
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,820
After a while, it will be replaced with foil

11
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,340
You two send him back

12
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,660
You take the rest of the people to expand the land

13
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:41,920
Give me all ten mothers before dark

14
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,640
Put my sign in all the empty spaces

15
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:45,710
What's the point of enclosing the land if you don't care about it?

16
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:46,670
Not all the ground is empty

17
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:50,400
I have food to eat
